Package: scDE
Type: Package
Title: Unified Single Cell Differential Expression
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person("William", "Showers", email = "bill.showers@refinedscience.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jairav", "Desai", email = "jai.desai@refinedscience.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Austin", "Gillen", email = "austin.gillen@refinedscience.com", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description:
    Tools for performing differential expression analysis in single cell objects
    and returning common results. scDE currently accepts Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment, AnnData and file-backed SCUBA (scuba_source) objects,
    with cell-level Wilcoxon tests and sample-level (pseudobulk) edgeR tests
    whose aggregation is delegated to SCUBA.
